        {
            "id": "7408123",
            "objective": "Recover the Punched Tapes",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7408124",
            "objective": "Talk to Sevigne",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "740812401",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "These are the tapes we're supposed to recover, right?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812402",
                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                    "text": "You show the recovered punched tapes to Sevigne..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812403",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "Yes, these are the ones! You guys are so efficient, not sloppy in the least!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812404",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Something as easy as this? No way we're not finishing that in a jiffy!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812405",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "That's still commendable. I'm not exaggerating when I say some of my colleagues could squander a whole day just to find one simple thing..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812406",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "Though let's not speak of that now. Please bring the punched tapes back to Chisseray."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812407",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "And tell her I won't be going back just yet. Oh, and let her know to get in touch with Maillardet and let him know he should recover the prototypes here ASAP."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812408",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "#Okay. So, {NICKNAME}, shall we go back the way we came?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812409",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "Oh, that won't be necessary."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812410",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "You two can dive, right? There is actually a waterway you can use. It was sealed to prevent accidental falls. I can open it back up."
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812411",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "#That will be great! Let's take the waterway, {NICKNAME}!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812412",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "The terminal to open it is inside. I can do that alone. You'll be fine getting out of here on your own, won't you? You won't get lost?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812413",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "#Of course, don't underestimate us! Paimon is the best guide in Teyvat. There's no way {NICKNAME} is getting lost with Paimon around!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "740812414",
                    "speaker": "Sevigne",
                    "text": "Good. Thanks for delivering the message and the punched tapes for me. Hope you don't mind if I don't show you out."
                }
            ]
        },
